{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48826","headline":"同诸公过福先寺律院宣上人房 · 欧阳詹","name":"同诸公过福先寺律院宣上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律座下朝讲，昼门犹掩关。\n叨同静者来，正值高云闲。\n寂尔方丈内，莹然虚白间。\n千灯智慧心，片玉清羸颜。\n松色落深井，竹阴寒小山。\n晤言流曦晚，惆怅归人寰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}